::'''Lygus:''' ...pretending the straw dummy propped up by a wooden pole was a giant with a single blood vessel running from spine to heel...
::'''Lygus:''' ...dreaming of slaying the giant and becoming a hero to save the world &mdash; though to his young mind, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|the "world" was just this small village}}.
